# Origin of the booking API (snr-admin/backend deployed on Vercel), no trailing slash.
# Required — there is no fallback, so a misconfigured build fails loudly instead of
# sending bookings to the wrong database.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-api-project.vercel.app

# Optional Google sign-in for renters (S&R Rewards tiers). Firebase console →
# Project settings → Your apps → Web app. Public identifiers, not secrets.
# Leave unset and sign-in is hidden — everyone books as a guest.
# Also: Authentication → Sign-in method → enable Google, and add this site's
# domain under Authentication → Settings → Authorized domains.
# VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
# VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=snrrentals-2fb0f.firebaseapp.com
# VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=snrrentals-2fb0f
# VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=

# Which sign-in options the sign-in window offers (comma-separated):
#   google, facebook, email   — default "google,email".
# Each must also be enabled in Firebase → Authentication → Sign-in method.
# Facebook needs a Meta app (App ID + App secret) pasted into Firebase there.
# VITE_AUTH_PROVIDERS=google,email
